].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"努力了這麼久，當聽到得獎的名字是自己時，她高興得(　)。","n":28,"ssz":"..............1.......1....."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"下列語詞何者使用不正確？","n":12,"ssz":"........1..."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一陣「凜冽」的寒風吹來，冷得我不由自主地縮起脖子","n":24,"ssz":".............1.....1...1"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他從二樓跳下來，竟然「毫髮無傷」，真讓人驚訝","n":22,"ssz":"......................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一想起跟好朋友吵架的事，我就「輾轉難眠」，一直睡不著","n":26,"ssz":"...............1.....2...."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"跑完一百公尺，我只能「奄奄一息」的喘氣","n":19,"ssz":"..................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"獵人在山中無法安心入睡，最可能的原因是什麼？","n":22,"ssz":"......................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他擔心下雪抓不到獵物","n":10,"ssz":"......1..."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他怕黑夜裡遇到狼群攻擊","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他擔心家裡的小寶和白牙是否平安","n":15,"ssz":"........1......"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他害怕明天天氣更差，會回不了家","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"獵人為什麼會懷疑白牙吃了小寶？","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"因為白牙肚子餓了","n":8,"ssz":".1...1.."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"因為朋友曾經警告他","n":9,"ssz":".1......."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"因為白牙很喜歡小寶","n":9,"ssz":".1......."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"因為白牙搖著尾巴迎接他","n":11,"ssz":".1.....1..."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第十三段提到：「白牙已經奄奄一息，但牠用盡全力，把尾巴搖了幾下。」為什麼白牙快死了，還在搖尾巴？","n":48,"ssz":"..........................1......1............1."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"因為白牙還是很信任主人","n":11,"ssz":".1........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"因為每隻狗臨死時都會搖尾巴","n":13,"ssz":".1..........1"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"因為白牙覺得主人在跟牠玩","n":12,"ssz":".1...1......"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"因為白牙想要主人給牠東西吃","n":13,"ssz":".1..........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"讀完本課，請問作者想要傳達什麼道理？","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"狗咬人的本性很難改變，要特別小心","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"衝動的決定可能帶來無法挽回的錯誤","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"不要單獨留小孩子在家裡，容易有意外發生","n":19,"ssz":"1......1..........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"防人之心不可無，即使是信任的朋友，也要有所保留","n":23,"ssz":"......................."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[0].threshold","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"＜190字","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[0].feedback","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"還要多加練習。","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[1].threshold","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"191~220字","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[1].feedback","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"嗯，還不錯喲！","n":7,"ssz":"...1..."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[2].threshold","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"＞221字","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[2].feedback","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"哇嗚，超級厲害！","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:key_reading.instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"請用計時器，從指定段落（四☞）開始朗讀，計時1分鐘讀的字數，並記錄在表格中。如果你計時3次後，對自己還不滿意，可以自己多練幾次喔。最後一次，找一位同學，請他來計時、記錄並簽名！","n":88,"ssz":"...............................................................1.......1................"},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第1次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第2次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第3次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"裁判計時","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.unit","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"字","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:key_reading.benchmark_label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎ 我的表現","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:key_reading.start_text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"獵人背起獵槍，走向白茫茫的山林。他巡視了之前設下","n":24,"ssz":"........................"},{"section":"served:text_type","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"單","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"在《白牙的最後一戰》裡，你可以看到獵人看到了滿地血跡，判斷白牙吃掉了小寶，因為一時的情緒和害怕，做出錯誤的決定，結果傷害了最忠心的朋友。生活中，我們其實也常遇到直接被情緒帶著走的時刻。\n那麼，情緒是怎麼來的呢？其實，情緒不只和事件本身有關，也會受到我們對事件的想法與解讀影響。心理學家將這個過程稱為「情緒管理的 ABC 模型」。","n":164,"ssz":".......1..............................1.....1...................................................................1...............................1..................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"在《白牙的最後一戰》裡，你可以看到獵人看到了滿地血跡，判斷白牙吃掉了小寶，因為一時的情緒和害怕，做出錯誤的決定，結果傷害了最忠心的朋友。生活中，我們其實也常遇到直接被情緒帶著走的時刻。","n":92,"ssz":".......1..............................1.....1..............................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"那麼，情緒是怎麼來的呢？其實，情緒不只和事件本身有關，也會受到我們對事件的想法與解讀影響。心理學家將這個過程稱為「情緒管理的 ABC 模型」。","n":71,"ssz":"...................1...............................1..................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"情緒管理的 ABC 模型","n":12,"ssz":"............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].rows[0][0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"A（事件）","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].rows[0][1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"發生的事（多數不可控）","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].rows[1][0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"B（認知）","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].rows[1][1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我們對事件的想法與解讀（可以練習調整）","n":19,"ssz":"..................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].rows[2][0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"C（情緒/結果）","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].rows[2][1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我們產生的情緒與行動反應（多數受B影響）","n":20,"ssz":"...........1........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"例如","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[0].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"下雨了(事件)我可能會塞車、遲到(認知)焦躁，罵人(情緒/結果)","n":32,"ssz":"................................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[1].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"下雨了(事件)雨水可以幫助作物生長(認知)開心、感謝上天(情緒/結果)","n":35,"ssz":"................1.................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"你發現了嗎？同一件事，因想法不同，可能產生不同的情緒和反應。","n":30,"ssz":"..........................1.1."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎換你試試看","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"下列的情況下，你可能會產生什麼情緒呢？","n":19,"ssz":"...