ved:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].rows[0].C情緒","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"開心、興奮","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].rows[1].B認知","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我平常都沒發現原來他有這些優點。","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].rows[1].C情緒","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"讚賞","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].rows[2].B認知","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"白牙平常一直很保護小寶，不可能會傷害小寶，我來看看發生了什麼事。","n":32,"ssz":"....2..........................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].rows[2].C情緒","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"擔心、緊張","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"你發現了嗎？改變「B-認知」，就可能產生不同的情緒，讓人感覺更舒服。所以，我們要練習換個角度看事情，就可以避免不可挽回的後果。","n":63,"ssz":"...........................................1..................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"例如 1（小明）","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].passage","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"小明開車時被別人超車嚇到，對方還按喇叭示威，他原來開心悠閒的心情一下變得又氣又急。他越想越生氣，猛踩油門想反超回去，結果因為速度過快而發生車禍。","n":72,"ssz":"................................1..1.........................1.........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].analysis","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"小明被別人超車了，他認為受到別人挑釁，心情很不爽。","n":25,"ssz":"........................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"想一想，如果你是小明，在被超車時，你要怎麼想，才可以避免自己做出衝動的事？（複選）","n":41,"ssz":"........................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"告訴自己「安全比逞一時之快重要」","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"告訴自己「人善被人欺，總不能一輩子當個受氣包」","n":23,"ssz":"..............1.1......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].options.3","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"告訴自己「我才不要和這樣的人吵架」","n":17,"ssz":".......1.1......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"紅色 ☑（圖形），被勾中的 □ 已從文字流消失","n":23,"ssz":"......................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"例如 2（小芳）","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].passage","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"小芳下課時聽到同學竊竊私語，還朝她看，心想：「一定在說我壞話！」她感到很生氣，正準備質問時，才發現他們只是討論分組名單，根本與她無關，結果是自己白生氣了一場。","n":79,"ssz":".......................1....................................................2.."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].analysis","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"小芳看到同學竊竊私語，她認為他們在說她壞話，覺得很生氣。","n":28,"ssz":".......................1...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"想一想，如果你是小芳，你可以如何改變認知？","n":21,"ssz":"....................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].answer_free_text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"告訴自己「事情還不確定前，不要急著下結論」","n":21,"ssz":"........1....1......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎自我檢核","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一、請你自己檢查以下3項，確定自己是否已經學會運用「情緒管理ABC模型」來思考與判斷。","n":43,"ssz":"..........................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].items[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.我能分辨A（事件）、B（想法）、C（情緒）之間的關係。","n":29,"ssz":"............................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].items[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.我會嘗試改變B（想法），並觀察情緒是否因此改變。","n":26,"ssz":".........................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].items[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"3.我能用改變想法的方式，避免因衝動做出錯誤決定。","n":25,"ssz":"........................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].closing","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"二、如果三項都打勾，恭喜你，你已經學會在情緒來臨時，做出更冷靜、更正確的選擇。你超厲害的！","n":45,"ssz":"................................1............"},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[0].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"背景","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[0].value","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.獵人住在森林邊，有一條忠心的狗白牙。白牙有【　】的血統，看起來兇猛，鎮上的人都很怕牠，但獵人很信任牠。\n2.獵人結婚後有了孩子──小寶。妻子過世後，獵人擔心外出打獵時，小寶一個人在家會有【　】，請白牙負責照顧小寶。","n":109,"ssz":"................................................................1......1.................1..................."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[0].value#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.獵人住在森林邊，有一條忠心的狗白牙。白牙有【　】的血統，看起來兇猛，鎮上的人都很怕牠，但獵人很信任牠。","n":53,"ssz":"....................................................."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[0].value#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.獵人結婚後有了孩子──小寶。妻子過世後，獵人擔心外出打獵時，小寶一個人在家會有【　】，請白牙負責照顧小寶。","n":55,"ssz":"..........1......1.................1..................."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[0].blanks[0].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"狼","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[0].blanks[1].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"危險","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[1].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"起因","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[1].value","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"冬天獵人上山查看陷阱，遇【　】無法回家，只能在山上過夜。他很擔心家裡的孩子和白牙。","n":41,"ssz":"....................................11..."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[1].blanks[0].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"暴風雪","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[2].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"經過","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[2].value","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"獵人回家後發現屋內一片混亂，滿地血跡，小寶不見，白牙滿身是血。\n他懷疑白牙【　】，一氣之下砍了白牙。這時從床底傳來小寶的哭聲。","n":63,"ssz":".....................1...................1....................."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[2].value#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"獵人回家後發現屋內一片混亂，滿地血跡，小寶不見，白牙滿身是血。","n":31,"ssz":".....................1........."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[2].value#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他懷疑白牙【　】，一氣之下砍了白牙。這時從床底傳來小寶的哭聲。","n":31,"ssz":".........1....................."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[2].b